    "Each PDF or picture put in a watched folder runs through its preset once it has stopped growing; the original moves to \"done\" or \"failed\" below the folder, and inkvolt-watch.log there gets a line per file. Folders are watched while Inkvolt PDF is open. For one watched without the app, see the command line (--help).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada PDF o imagen que se pone en una carpeta vigilada pasa por su ajuste predefinido cuando deja de crecer; el original se mueve a \"done\" o \"failed\" dentro de la carpeta, e inkvolt-watch.log recibe allí una línea por archivo. Las carpetas se vigilan mientras Inkvolt PDF está abierto. Para vigilar una sin la aplicación, consulta la línea de comandos (--help)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each row of {0} fills a copy of this form. A row with a value the form refuses isn't saved and is listed in the report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada fila de {0} llena una copia de este formulario. Una fila con un valor que el formulario rechaza no se guarda y aparece en el informe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each table becomes a sheet, named after its page. Numbers stay numbers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
