    "The marked areas are blacked out and their content removed. Page {0} becomes a picture: its links, comments and form fields are flattened into it, and the text left on it is recognized again so it can still be searched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
