    },
    "The saved file opens without a password, and anyone can print, copy and change it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El archivo guardado se abre sin contraseña, y cualquiera puede imprimirlo, copiarlo y cambiarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scale is saved in the document, as Acrobat does, so later measurements here or in other apps use it. Measurements already made keep theirs. Parts of a page with a scale of their own (a detail) keep it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La escala se guarda en el documento, como hace Acrobat, así que las mediciones posteriores aquí o en otras aplicaciones la usan. Las mediciones ya hechas conservan la suya. Las partes de una página con escala propia (un detalle) la conservan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scan couldn't be made into a PDF: {0}": {
